# Generated on every gate run — not source. The integrity report embeds a timestamp and the
# absolute path of whoever ran it, so committing it only produced churn (KB audit F20).
# The gate still writes it locally; C-117 describes the output, it does not require a commit.
architecture/registry-integrity-report.md
architecture/registry-integrity-report.json

# Python bytecode from running scripts/
__pycache__/
